Description: See and control this computer from a paired phone at home
 The laptop side of Curfew. A paired Android phone on the same Wi-Fi can see
 who is logged in, shut the computer down now or after a countdown, lock or
 log out an account, let an account in without its password being typed, and
 turn the internet off for one account.
 .
